    ('383d433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', 'vitascan-monitor', 'VitaScan Non-Invasive Tracker', 1, '923c433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', '803c433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', 'A revolutionary wearable that tracks metabolic health through dermal sensors. It provides immediate feedback on how different foods affect your energy levels, helping users optimize their diet via data.', 'Optical spectroscopy sensor. Measures interstitial glucose trends. Sample rate 5min. Syncs with mobile dashboards. Medical-grade silicone build.'),
