    ('703d433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', 'trek-torch-max', 'TrekTorch 1000 Headlamp', 1, '913c433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', '833c433e-f36b-1410-8adb-00ab2e36627d', 'Illuminate your path with a powerful 1000-lumen beam. This headlamp features reactive lighting technology that automatically adjusts brightness based on where you are looking, preserving battery life for long hikes.', '1000 lumens peak. Reactive lighting sensor. IP67 waterproof. Red light mode for night vision. Rechargeable 3500mAh battery.'),
